# KF Meeting Access Codes

All meeting access codes displayed on the website MUST match the **"New Code KF Website"** column from the KF Meeting Code Generator spreadsheet located at `.cursor/KF Meeting Code Generator 2026.xlsx`.

## Authoritative Codes (from "New Code KF Website" column)

| Meeting                  | Access Code     |
|--------------------------|-----------------|
| KF 1 Sunday Morning      | 548-008-425#    |
| KF 2 Sunday Evening      | 646-522-354#    |
| KF 3 Monday Morning      | 591-492-083#    |
| KF 4 Tuesday Evening     | 209-466-826#    |
| NHG Saturday AM           | 226-621-530#    |
| NHG Weekend Intensive     | 546-213-115#    |
| Bible Study Romans        | 158-890-796#    |
| Special Studies (HPKP)    | 903-351-258#    |
| Phone Number              | (701) 801-1220  |

## Rules

1. NEVER use old codes — always use the "New Code KF Website" column values above.
2. When adding or editing any page that displays access codes, verify against this table.
3. Format codes with dashes and a trailing `#` (e.g., `548-008-425#`).
4. If the spreadsheet is updated, this rule must also be updated to match.
